      "ho_id": "HO2",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": false
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00051",
          "explanation": "The doctor directly states that hMPV does not have a specific antiviral and that the current supportive treatments are the standard of care, correcting the misconception that a missing 'antiviral' means the treatment is wrong.",
          "quote": "偏肺病毒（hMPV）是病毒，目前没有针对它的特效抗病毒药，临床就是支持对症"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00072",
          "explanation": "The doctor explains that lung consolidation is an imaging sign that usually resolves, not an irreversible or catastrophic outcome, directly correcting the caregiver’s fear.",
          "quote": "肺实变不是“一种病”，是胸片/CT上的一个影像表现，意思是那一小块肺里空气被炎症的液体/细胞填满了"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor corrected the core pathogen/lung-consolidation misunderstandings but did not explicitly distinguish chlamydia from hMPV as separate pathogen classes or check that the caregiver no longer intended to self-change medicine, so the full completion criteria are only partially met.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
