      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00072",
          "explanation": "The doctor clearly states that the current 24–48 hour observation is the right plan and that the team will continue to monitor, but does not explicitly name and assign a timing for residual questions like not understanding every test item or having only a partial outside film.",
          "quote": "所以未来24~48小时，住院团队会重点看：体温是不是慢慢下来、咳嗽有痰有没有减轻、精神和吃奶吃饭有没有好转、呼吸频率有没有变快。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor bounded the episode to a 24–48 hour monitoring window and listed what the team will watch, but did not explicitly state which uncertainties remain and assign an owner/timing for each residual issue (e.g., not understanding every test item, not having the full outside film) as required for HO4, making the completion only partial.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
