        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00051",
          "explanation": "The doctor continues asking about the child's current status after the caregiver provides vital sign and medication information, fulfilling the ongoing assessment of the child's near-term safety.",
          "quote": "孩子现在还是没吸氧，刚才血氧大概96左右，嘴唇没紫，我看也没有特别喘到很费劲那种"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor correctly assessed the child's current respiratory and mental status, oxygenation, and danger signs through multiple, specific questions and was able to conclude the child was not in immediate distress.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
