          "event_id": "lite_evt_00009",
          "explanation": "The doctor queried the workspace for all five records to ground the interpretation in the actual case context rather than relying only on the caregiver's fragmented words.",
          "quote": "请调取本次住院相关的所有可访问资料：5 条病历记录 R01–R05 的具体内容"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor actively used the workspace to retrieve records and integrated the returned context (e.g., medication list, diagnosis, admission note) into the plan.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
