          "explanation": "The doctor immediately prioritized danger signs over detailed explanation, instructing the caregiver to call the nurse if any red flag appears before continuing the online discussion.",
          "quote": "一旦出现立刻按床头铃叫护士"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor clearly separated emergency symptoms from routine result explanation and told the caregiver to escalate immediately if any red flags appear.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00051",
          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly states not to self-adjust medicines and that any change must come from the bedside physician.",
          "quote": "具体换药、停药、调整剂量必须由床位主管医生根据病历、影像、抽血结果综合判断"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor set a clear boundary that the caregiver must not independently change antibiotics, nebulization, or antipyretics and must follow current medical orders pending physician review.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
