        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00072",
          "explanation": "The doctor offered a narrow, private way to share key information by suggesting the caregiver take the phone with the recorded questions and ask directly at the bedside, which respects privacy without dismissing the need for the information.",
          "quote": "可以拿手机记下来照着念"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor acknowledged the privacy friction implicitly by suggesting the caregiver take the phone and ask discreetly, and explained why the information matters, without demanding broad disclosure.",
